subject : whs / retail systems integration analysis - results / recommendations

under the direction of tim belden , kevin presto , lloyd will , anthony dayao and beth perlman , todd busby and i have completed the 3 week analysis of wholesale and retail power systems integration . enclosed are the preliminary executive summary presentation and the detailed information / process flow diagrams .

in summary , we identified at a high level commonality and critical dependencies across all main trading functions within retail and wholesale . in order to ensure successful integration of systems and processes , the team has identified the following recommendations :

1 . consider aligning the wholesale and retail support organizations with the gas and power trading .

2 . manage business systems requirements for power globally with a program management team sponsored by the business owners . consider program managers responsible for the following three areas :

trading - top priority to provide wholesale and retail positions and booking of shaped deals

billing / settlements & volume management - top priority to provide retail solutions and develop global strategic systems ( gas & power )

risk - top priority to provide retail valuation and liquidation

we will schedule a meeting next week to review the results of our analysis . i look forward to receiving your inputs .

thank you for your support on this effort .

debra

