strong quarter for equigold

seasoned gold producer equigold has delivered shareholders another good quarter at its australian operations , topped off by some strongly mineralised drill intersections at its bonikro project in cote d ivoire including 22 m grading 14 . 86 gpt from 95 m depth . . . ( 23 january 2004 )

