dear everyone ,

it looks like the proposed bblop has great support and is to have a great

start . vince , grant , , amitava , kevin , clayton and chonawee have promised

to give presentations to us . vince will kindly deliver the inaugural

presentation next friday ( march 31 ) on new methodology for option pricing

( precise title

tba ) . bblop will start at 12 noon and last about 45 to 50 minutes . let ' s

make this a new enron tradition !

best regards .

zimin ,

