here ' s the rule for bargains : ' ' do other men , for they would do you . ' ' that ' s the true business precept . death is a shadow that always follows the body . in the arts , the critic is the only independent source of information . the rest is advertising .

for the last third of life there remains only work . it alone is always stimulating , rejuvenating , exciting and satisfying .
